# ============================================================================
# macubuntu Supply-Chain Lockfile (Pinned Commits & Verified SHA-256 Digests)
# Format (pipe-delimited, 7 fields):
#   ID | TYPE | URL | VERSION_OR_COMMIT | SHA256 | DATE_VERIFIED | LICENSE_SOURCE
#
# Rules:
#   - TYPE=file : SHA256 MUST be a 64-hex-char SHA-256 verified before install.
#                 NEVER use floating "latest" URLs.
#   - TYPE=git  : VERSION_OR_COMMIT MUST be an exact 40-hex-char commit SHA.
#                 Clones detach to that exact commit and verify signatures when available.
#   - To add/update an entry, verify upstream signature/checksum and update DATE_VERIFIED.
# ============================================================================

